From a78c6cde05084b32bc59af0fe9598740f9877f00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ARYA <AryaAlikhani@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 13:57:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] boringssl: implement RFC 8449 record size limits

Negotiate directional TLS record limits, stage them by traffic-key epoch,
fragment protected records, enforce inbound bounds, and decline unsupported
0-RTT/DTLS/QUIC/handoff combinations.

